                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<div>You can use Open Science Framework (OSF) to manage your projects and register your studies. When you connect your OSF account to your ORCID iD, your preprints can be added to your ORCID record automatically by Crossref and prereregistrations can be added by DataCite. To add preprints and preregistrations published without your ORCID iD in the metadata, search & link wizards can be used.<br></div>"
                }
              }
